        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    stock_price = 48.6\n    strike_price = 45\n    risk_free_rate = 0.003\n    time_to_expiration = 0.25\n    n_d1 = 0.6352\n    n_d2 = 0.5486\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    from math import exp\n\n    put_price = (\n        strike_price * exp(-risk_free_rate * time_to_expiration) * (1 - n_d2)\n        - stock_price * (1 - n_d1)\n    )\n\n    answer = round(put_price, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
